{"5159870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Needle In A Haystack Simulator", "steam_appid": 5159870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5191440], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159870/extras/d58a161d7cbca206287b95891e06dc70.poster.avif?t=1788275496\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159870/extras/d58a161d7cbca206287b95891e06dc70.webm?t=1788275496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159870/extras/d58a161d7cbca206287b95891e06dc70.mp4?t=1788275496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>FIND THE NEEDLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere inside <strong>5,000,000 individual pieces of hay</strong> is a single needle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, finding a needle in a haystack is about as easy as it sounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >START WITH NOTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning, it's just you and the haystack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick through the pile piece by piece, searching for the needle and uncovering valuables hidden amongst the hay along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell what you find and use the money to make your impossible task slightly less impossible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR SEARCH... OR DON'T</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find valuables, sell them and buy increasingly powerful tools that let you search, move and process larger amounts of hay at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you progress, the more ridiculous your search operation becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, if you want the <strong>true needle-in-a-haystack experience</strong>, play with no upgrades at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tools. No automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, <strong>5,000,000 pieces of hay and 1 needle</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND IT WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to suffer alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends and search through millions of pieces of hay together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More players. More tools. Same needle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159870/extras/d58a161d7cbca206287b95891e06dc70.poster.avif?t=1788275496\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159870/extras/d58a161d7cbca206287b95891e06dc70.webm?t=1788275496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159870/extras/d58a161d7cbca206287b95891e06dc70.mp4?t=1788275496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>FIND THE NEEDLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere inside <strong>5,000,000 individual pieces of hay</strong> is a single needle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, finding a needle in a haystack is about as easy as it sounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >START WITH NOTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning, it's just you and the haystack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick through the pile piece by piece, searching for the needle and uncovering valuables hidden amongst the hay along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell what you find and use the money to make your impossible task slightly less impossible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR SEARCH... OR DON'T</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find valuables, sell them and buy increasingly powerful tools that let you search, move and process larger amounts of hay at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you progress, the more ridiculous your search operation becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, if you want the <strong>true needle-in-a-haystack experience</strong>, play with no upgrades at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tools. No automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, <strong>5,000,000 pieces of hay and 1 needle</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND IT WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to suffer alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends and search through millions of pieces of hay together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More players. More tools. Same needle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck.</strong></p>", "short_description": "The viral one. The one and only. Find 1 needle hidden amongst 5,000,000 pieces of hay.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159870/8980900568ead38e73d1538557fe9ff9d987bedd/header.jpg?t=1788275496", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159870/1a3f7bd1e0ae522d663abcac7837f87f28077b49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788275496", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5159870/1a3f7bd1e0ae522d663abcac7837f87f28077b49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788275496", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Gr